---
// Steps timeline component showing how the Christmas light installation process works
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 relative z-10 py-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <!-- Step 1 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col py-10 relative group/feature border-gray-200 border-l border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-r md:border-l">
    <div class="opacity-0 group-hover/feature:opacity-100 transition duration-200 absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-[#498dcb]/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="mb-4 relative z-10 px-10 text-[#498dcb]">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#498dcb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-[#498dcb]">1</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xl font-heading font-semibold mb-2 relative z-10 px-10">
      <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0 h-6 group-hover/feature:h-8 w-1 rounded-tr-full rounded-br-full bg-gray-300 group-hover/feature:bg-[#498dcb] transition-all duration-200 origin-center" />
      <span class="group-hover/feature:translate-x-2 transition duration-200 inline-block text-gray-800 font-heading">
        Get Your Free Quote
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-600 max-w-xs relative z-10 px-10 leading-relaxed">
      Contact us for a free consultation. We'll discuss your vision and provide a detailed quote with no hidden fees.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 2 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col py-10 relative group/feature border-gray-200 border-l border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-r">
    <div class="opacity-0 group-hover/feature:opacity-100 transition duration-200 absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-[#498dcb]/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="mb-4 relative z-10 px-10 text-[#498dcb]">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#498dcb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-[#498dcb]">2</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xl font-heading font-semibold mb-2 relative z-10 px-10">
      <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0 h-6 group-hover/feature:h-8 w-1 rounded-tr-full rounded-br-full bg-gray-300 group-hover/feature:bg-[#498dcb] transition-all duration-200 origin-center" />
      <span class="group-hover/feature:translate-x-2 transition duration-200 inline-block text-gray-800 font-heading">
        Custom Design & Planning
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-600 max-w-xs relative z-10 px-10 leading-relaxed">
      We create a custom design plan for your home, choose the perfect color scheme, and schedule your installation date.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 3 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col py-10 relative group/feature border-gray-200 border-l border-t border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-t-0 md:border-r md:border-l">
    <div class="opacity-0 group-hover/feature:opacity-100 transition duration-200 absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#498dcb]/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="mb-4 relative z-10 px-10 text-[#498dcb]">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#498dcb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-[#498dcb]">3</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xl font-heading font-semibold mb-2 relative z-10 px-10">
      <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0 h-6 group-hover/feature:h-8 w-1 rounded-tr-full rounded-br-full bg-gray-300 group-hover/feature:bg-[#498dcb] transition-all duration-200 origin-center" />
      <span class="group-hover/feature:translate-x-2 transition duration-200 inline-block text-gray-800 font-heading">
        Professional Installation
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-600 max-w-xs relative z-10 px-10 leading-relaxed">
      Our expert team installs your lights using professional-grade equipment. We provide all lights and materials.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 4 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col py-10 relative group/feature border-gray-200 border-l border-t border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-t-0 md:border-r">
    <div class="opacity-0 group-hover/feature:opacity-100 transition duration-200 absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#498dcb]/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="mb-4 relative z-10 px-10 text-[#498dcb]">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#498dcb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-[#498dcb]">✓</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xl font-heading font-semibold mb-2 relative z-10 px-10">
      <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0 h-6 group-hover/feature:h-8 w-1 rounded-tr-full rounded-br-full bg-gray-300 group-hover/feature:bg-[#498dcb] transition-all duration-200 origin-center" />
      <span class="group-hover/feature:translate-x-2 transition duration-200 inline-block text-gray-800 font-heading">
        Enjoy & We Maintain
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-600 max-w-xs relative z-10 px-10 leading-relaxed">
      Relax and enjoy your beautiful display! We handle maintenance, repairs, and free storage throughout the year.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
